    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Grimgig Railway to your wishlist to support us \ud83c\udf38</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213910/extras/8630b3405c987ec92792e12d1ec14b1b.poster.avif?t=1739995332\" width=494 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213910/extras/8630b3405c987ec92792e12d1ec14b1b.webm?t=1739995332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213910/extras/8630b3405c987ec92792e12d1ec14b1b.mp4?t=1739995332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome and congratulations, it's your first day as a locomotive driver on the Sakura National Railway! \ud83c\udf38</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your duty to keep the train moving and take it to the next station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are providing freight services or a luxury trip by rail, the fires of motivation within you should burn as brightly as the fire in your engine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We provide the highest in service standards, and your services are no exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balance between pressure and speed is essential, but taking care of the company\u2019s hardware is even more important! Be sure to keep an eye on your new teammate using the camera system \u2014 you will need to check if it\u2019s \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 or \u2588\u2588\u2588, you never know what can happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and we\u2019ll talk tomorrow night, when you arrive to the next station. Safe travels, \u2588\u2588\u2588!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror on Rails</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimgig Railway is a horror game with train simulation elements where you\u2019ll need to keep calm and face your fears. You\u2019ll drive the train across an old railway in Sakura valley, deep in the Japanese countryside. Search stations and villages for answers to what happened to the region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find out soon enough why not everyone can keep this job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the locomotive\u2019s speed, pressure and fuel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the TV circuit for abnormal activities in the train cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mail bags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit stations and Villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you can even use the train whistle. Choo-choo!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Grimgig Railway to your wishlist to support us \ud83c\udf38</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213910/extras/8630b3405c987ec92792e12d1ec14b1b.poster.avif?t=1739995332\" width=494 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213910/extras/8630b3405c987ec92792e12d1ec14b1b.webm?t=1739995332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213910/extras/8630b3405c987ec92792e12d1ec14b1b.mp4?t=1739995332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome and congratulations, it's your first day as a locomotive driver on the Sakura National Railway! \ud83c\udf38</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your duty to keep the train moving and take it to the next station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are providing freight services or a luxury trip by rail, the fires of motivation within you should burn as brightly as the fire in your engine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We provide the highest in service standards, and your services are no exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balance between pressure and speed is essential, but taking care of the company\u2019s hardware is even more important! Be sure to keep an eye on your new teammate using the camera system \u2014 you will need to check if it\u2019s \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 or \u2588\u2588\u2588, you never know what can happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and we\u2019ll talk tomorrow night, when you arrive to the next station. Safe travels, \u2588\u2588\u2588!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror on Rails</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimgig Railway is a horror game with train simulation elements where you\u2019ll need to keep calm and face your fears. You\u2019ll drive the train across an old railway in Sakura valley, deep in the Japanese countryside. Search stations and villages for answers to what happened to the region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find out soon enough why not everyone can keep this job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the locomotive\u2019s speed, pressure and fuel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the TV circuit for abnormal activities in the train cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mail bags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit stations and Villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you can even use the train whistle. Choo-choo!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
